                                                "sense_id": "5514d8a5-89a1-3653-b9bd-a4ead235d463",
                                                "text": "to be dressed in full regalia (dressed up)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05d664c0-692e-483d-917d-6ae3c80e0d17",
                                                "sense_id": "5514d8a5-89a1-3653-b9bd-a4ead235d463",
                                                "text": "[…] the throngs included tribes of American Indians celebrating […] like victorious conventioneers in their burnished regalia at a hotel party Monday night."
                                            }
